! Plant loop that the water source heat pumps of the xlsx (type 15) need: a mixed water loop with a cooling tower (the xlsx names a fluid cooler) and a fossil fuel (natural gas) boiler. The xlsx gives no sizes or efficiencies.
  HVACTemplate:Plant:MixedWaterLoop,
    Mixed Water Loop;             !- Name

  HVACTemplate:Plant:Tower,
    Tower 1,                      !- Name
    SingleSpeed,                  !- Tower Type  Source: xlsx HVAC System Type 15 (fluid cooler; a tower is the template object that is available): HVAC System Type Dictionary row 17; Zone and HVAC System Summary column G rows 495-520 (24 rows).
    ,                             !- High Speed Nominal Capacity
    ,                             !- High Speed Fan Power
    ,                             !- Low Speed Nominal Capacity
    ,                             !- Low Speed Fan Power
    ,                             !- Free Convection Capacity
    ,                             !- Priority
    ,                             !- Sizing Factor
    ;                             !- Template Plant Loop Type

  HVACTemplate:Plant:Boiler,
    Boiler 1,                     !- Name
    HotWaterBoiler,               !- Boiler Type
    ,                             !- Capacity
    ,                             !- Efficiency
    NaturalGas,                   !- Fuel Type  Source: xlsx HVAC System Type 15 (gas boiler): HVAC System Type Dictionary row 17; Zone and HVAC System Summary column G rows 495-520 (24 rows).
    ,                             !- Priority
    ,                             !- Sizing Factor
    ,                             !- Minimum Part Load Ratio
    ,                             !- Maximum Part Load Ratio
    ,                             !- Optimum Part Load Ratio
    ,                             !- Water Outlet Upper Temperature Limit
    ;                             !- Template Plant Loop Type
